WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:02.710
Section fourteen.

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:05.299
Tokenomics and optimization.

00:00:06.728 --> 00:00:09.448
The purpose is to understand what each decision consumes

00:00:09.448 --> 00:00:11.328
and which costs can be avoided.

00:00:12.836 --> 00:00:14.596
We separate historical estimates,

00:00:15.436 --> 00:00:18.316
conservative admission bounds, and the broader cost of a

00:00:18.316 --> 00:00:19.976
useful accepted relationship.

00:00:29.827 --> 00:00:32.887
The harness pins a rate snapshot and counts assembled

00:00:32.887 --> 00:00:33.287
input.

00:00:34.997 --> 00:00:38.457
It reserves possible output, a conservative cache-write allowance,

00:00:38.957 --> 00:00:41.297
and headroom without assuming a cache discount.

00:00:43.247 --> 00:00:46.147
Known usage later settles in integer microdollars.

00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:50.937
Reasoning tokens already belong to output and must not

00:00:50.937 --> 00:00:51.837
be added twice.

00:00:53.047 --> 00:00:56.727
A maximum-output reservation is not a prediction of the

00:00:56.727 --> 00:00:57.947
answer's usual length.

00:01:03.593 --> 00:01:07.713
The twenty-case API round made twenty generation requests and

00:01:07.713 --> 00:01:09.193
twenty input-count requests:

00:01:09.993 --> 00:01:12.333
forty provider HTTP operations.

00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:17.633
It recorded sixteen thousand forty-one input tokens and three

00:01:17.633 --> 00:01:20.193
thousand four hundred fourteen output tokens.

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:24.833
The rounded inference estimate was about three-tenths of a

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:24.953
cent.

00:01:25.713 --> 00:01:27.233
This excludes media,

00:01:28.193 --> 00:01:30.253
infrastructure, indexing, and human review;

00:01:31.513 --> 00:01:33.453
it is not a production cost guarantee.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:40.310
Compact evidence,

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:45.150
candidate caps, and bounded collection sampling reduce individual

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:47.950
requests, but can omit useful context.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:52.210
Receipts and local reconciliation can avoid another request

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:52.790
entirely.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:57.390
Provider prompt caching still invokes a model, and no

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.390
discount benefit appeared in that round.

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:01.210
Count latency,

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:02.650
evidence refresh,

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.970
storage, and reviewer corrections also matter.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:10.810
Optimize cost per correct, accepted, current association.
